Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.34,0:22:53.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've been laying down the tracks for 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.68,0:22:57.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to break through on on on a lot of massive cures for the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.64,0:23:07.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course, ChatGPT is already helping parents plan their day and solve their kids health issue and helping them uh get get better educated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.44,0:23:12.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um talk to us a little bit though as to why that's having such a hard time breaking through, Jensen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.46,0:23:17.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have all of these things that are out there improving lives and that are right around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.47,0:23:23.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so that that's kind of curious to me as to why that's not breaking through.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.32,0:23:27.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um I guess I guess um let me take a shot at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.05,0:23:31.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um and and you know, we'll we'll ultimately not really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.76,0:23:35.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um I I've spoken to a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.28,0:23:36.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,They told me what they thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:42.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, one of the one of the things of course is is a AI or superintelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.21,0:23:44.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is a is soft matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.32,0:23:44.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.84,0:23:47.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't look you can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.20,0:23:51.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and so you got the whole world talking about this technology, but you can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.77,0:23:52.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.64,0:23:52.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.00,0:23:55.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And even though they're already benefiting from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.08,0:23:57.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,When they do search, they're already benefiting from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.06,0:23:58.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,When they go shopping, they're benefiting from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.97,0:24:01.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,When they're when they're using Netflix, they're benefiting from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.76,0:24:04.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, you go to Walmart, you're benefiting from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.89,0:24:13.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh the the fact that FedEx is getting getting stuff to us, you know, It's all leveraging superintelligence and accelerated compute today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.49,0:24:15.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we don't do a very good job telling that story.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.00,0:24:18.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,I I often think that life is they're benefiting from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.19,0:24:19.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's just it's invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.40,0:24:19.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.76,0:24:25.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,So if we shut off the data centers and shut off superintelligence for for a weekend, I think everybody would notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.92,0:24:26.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.28,0:24:26.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.55,0:24:29.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I know you had a question about robotics in particular though.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.16,0:24:29.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.55,0:24:35.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,I guess you you've you've said notably said a few times this year that the chat GPT moment for robotics is here.
