Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.16,0:24:52.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I I understated the hundred billion dollars because we're we're already the first six months of this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.09,0:24:54.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,we did ten billion dollars in physical AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.32,0:25:02.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Physical AI is basically you know, AI that's somehow interacting with the physical world and it could be photon photon counting CT machines,
