Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.20,0:25:09.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.56,0:25:13.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not only does it understand radio waves, it's going to understand signals of all kinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.12,0:25:16.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a sensing network.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.16,0:25:22.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um of course robotics, self-driving cars, manufacturing systems, visual inspections, uh you know,
