Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.96,0:25:46.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and so so we and we're doing work across that entire thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.94,0:25:52.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,That and and and and as an AI, there's there's a the perception part of it,
