Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.56,0:26:02.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you finally get into planning and actuation, then that's self-driving cars and robotics and things like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.14,0:26:08.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know, in in warehouse delivery vehicles, pick and place robots that you don't have to program,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.40,0:26:14.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know, as as precisely because it learns by itself, you know, all the way to people talking about consumer robots,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.44,0:26:17.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know, coming into your house, you know, making your bed and things.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.66,0:26:23.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so or health care robots, hospital robots, lots of really good examples there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.36,0:26:34.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Precisely delivering exactly your prescription to the patient um having having robotic care literally 24/7 every single
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.97,0:26:41.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,second um to to keep patients safe um and so just lots and lots of great examples,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.55,0:26:44.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,entire surgical rooms that are going to be completely robotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.56,0:26:44.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.00,0:26:48.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so lots of great technology being deployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.00,0:26:53.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so if you look at this whole thing, we're the world's largest physical AI company.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.33,0:26:55.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,We We did $10 billion in the first 6 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.02,0:26:59.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We did $10 billion in the last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.20,0:27:00.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that was our first $10 billion year.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.00,0:27:02.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The year before that we did five.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.00,0:27:03.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.35,0:27:06.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we went five, 10, let's say we did 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.00,0:27:07.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.63,0:27:10.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,So maybe the 100 was a little understated.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.04,0:27:18.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and I I think the reasoning part of it is is everything that matters to us in the final analysis touches the physical world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.67,0:27:20.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and we live in the physical world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.74,0:27:27.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so I I think the the market opportunity for bringing uh software, computing,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.02,0:27:35.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,intelligence into an industry that largely historically was mechanical, electrical, that's a big opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.69,0:27:40.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, look at look at obviously what Elon has done to the to the automotive industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.88,0:27:44.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Turned it into essentially a computing industry, a technology industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.65,0:27:48.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so I think every car company's going to be a technology company.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.68,0:27:52.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every shipping and receiving's company the logistics company's going to be a technology company.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.13,0:27:53.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm super excited for FedEx.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.39,0:27:54.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're obviously going to be an AI company.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.04,0:27:57.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're obviously going to be a technology company.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.40,0:28:01.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Walmart obviously going to be a technology company an AI company.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.20,0:28:03.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,So super excited for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.84,0:28:08.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The entire telecommunications industry will be reinvented again into an into a technology industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.72,0:28:11.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,They were a technology industry a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.28,0:28:12.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,They became a services industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.50,0:28:14.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're going to be a technology industry again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.60,0:28:22.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I'm delighted to work with AT&T and Verizon and all, you know, the and in Europe around the world as they reinvent themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.12,0:28:26.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um and so you you take a look at every one of these industries that touch the physical world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.34,0:28:30.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I there's a a great idea for reinventing them with AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.20,0:28:35.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, we we um I was just in Washington weird, you know, people put us in chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.40,0:28:36.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.20,0:28:40.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, and and so we're actually in warehousing logistics.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.48,0:28:41.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.32,0:28:42.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're in healthcare.
