Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.04,0:28:44.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're in automotive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.28,0:28:46.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're in telecommunications.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.12,0:28:46.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.72,0:28:48.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every industry in the Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.06,0:28:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and so so we're in light we're we're in we're in life sciences, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.08,0:28:59.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,and so so all these entertainment obviously for a long for a long time Nvidia was really vastly an entertainment company,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.16,0:29:09.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know, and so so each one of these verticals uh Nvidia has has a massive stack that's inside of it and and we're very deep in the ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.00,0:29:12.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh and we have excellent partnerships there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.47,0:29:18.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so you know, one of these days, you know, people might not categorize us as a chip company anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.20,0:29:25.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,would be to take the Alpha IO automotive I guess playbook and insert it into each one of these industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.16,0:29:29.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's that's the final that's the final um contribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.26,0:29:37.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,But in each one of these it takes three computers to build a physical AI platform and so so you need you need a computer to create the brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.64,0:29:39.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,that's the training system.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.52,0:29:44.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,But very importantly and this is where where you're going to see the labs also do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.80,0:29:49.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um they need to build a digital twin of the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.52,0:29:54.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that they don't have to put their AI agents out into the internet to learn how to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.60,0:29:59.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so just like we we created Omniverse as the digital twin of warehouses and
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.24,0:30:03.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,buildings and cities in the physical world we put our robot into the digital twin,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.92,0:30:05.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,the digital twin learns how to be a robot,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.77,0:30:09.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,and then we deploy it into the last computer, which is the computer that's inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.67,0:30:13.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know, for example, a robot or a car or surgical instrument or whatever it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.96,0:30:20.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so it takes three robots, three computers and three complete stacks and we build complete stacks for each one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.27,0:30:22.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're the only company in the world that does that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.19,0:30:30.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then if you're a company that that wants to build it end to end, you could use two or three or you know, one of our computers, we don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.33,0:30:32.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so and so each one of our computer has its own software stack.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.99,0:30:35.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We do the same across all of our verticals.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.12,0:30:43.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um but of course these capabilities cut both ways, which is why um you know, we hear a lot of people talking about safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.67,0:30:47.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've been highly critical of the doomer narrative.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.36,0:30:50.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can only get there if you build the technology responsibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.08,0:30:50.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.88,0:30:54.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the first thing is build the technology responsibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.72,0:30:55.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.68,0:30:56.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Notice the word build.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.69,0:30:58.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's an engineering word.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.08,0:30:58.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.88,0:31:01.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's about technology, it's about engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.12,0:31:07.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Engineers, scientists, researchers, we have to build this technology safely, responsibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.01,0:31:10.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and the question is, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.24,0:31:13.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the the the answer is absolutely yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.40,0:31:16.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because if you can't, then you shouldn't build it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.80,0:31:17.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.80,0:31:21.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, we either have to believe we can or we shouldn't build it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.75,0:31:22.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.08,0:31:23.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, I believe we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.20,0:31:26.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, here, let me just reason about it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.08,0:31:36.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, the first part of it is they say some people say that that AI is is uncontrollable because it's impossible to align perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.58,0:31:39.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alignment means this for all the audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.24,0:31:42.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, you tell somebody, um, I want you to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.36,0:31:42.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.84,0:31:44.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the mission is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.04,0:31:45.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.28,0:31:46.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,The mission is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.56,0:31:49.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, um, I it's clear to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.52,0:31:49.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.84,0:31:52.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because you said it in English, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.20,0:31:55.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, it could be, uh, I want you to solve this quadratic equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.48,0:31:55.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.00,0:31:58.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the the mission is to solve the quadratic equation.
