Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.42,0:32:01.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are many ways to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.93,0:32:03.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,For example, you memorized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.76,0:32:04.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.32,0:32:04.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.66,0:32:07.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the answer is, you know, whatever it is.
