Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.94,0:33:00.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,to be kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.77,0:33:07.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Some people might mean that contribute to society make a lot of money and and then give philanthropic.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.76,0:33:09.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Some people might so and so forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.23,0:33:09.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.00,0:33:10.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.32,0:33:10.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.58,0:33:18.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And some people might just think that that building a company alone is is or doing something alone is is a sufficient contribution to society.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.68,0:33:21.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Creating a beautiful piece of art or all of it is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.88,0:33:22.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.32,0:33:24.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the question is what's the alignment?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.62,0:33:29.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it just depends on your background, your culture, maybe has something to do with where you live, where you came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.95,0:33:31.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's just infinite number of ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.00,0:33:35.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so my point is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.16,0:33:37.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alignment is going to be a forever problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.32,0:33:38.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.20,0:33:44.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,If we depend on perfect alignment in order to ensure safety, then we're never going to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.24,0:33:46.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the answer is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.28,0:33:54.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The way we treat the way we think about babies and when we we're raising kids and you know, we have pets or whatever it is, employees.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.60,0:33:55.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.32,0:33:57.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,You start with containment.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.32,0:34:02.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,You give them the rights that the access to tools, the access to information,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.82,0:34:07.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,the access to whatever responsibility capabilities that they have, funds, resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.16,0:34:11.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,You give them access based on the job that you ask them to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.15,0:34:13.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,You start out with zero trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.29,0:34:15.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you hire somebody, you start out with zero trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.35,0:34:20.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you have a baby that's 1 year old, you put them in a playpen, you assume zero trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.20,0:34:26.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so you zero trust, you give them minimum rights and you expand that boundary as you learn more.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.89,0:34:31.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so when whenever we have a new AI, we have to assume the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.15,0:34:41.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whenever you're testing an AI, zero trust, minimum boundaries, minimum rights, and you expand it as you test and give yourself confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.15,0:34:46.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, containment, very tight containment is really important to any autonomous system.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.28,0:34:49.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Second thing you do, uh monitoring.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.88,0:34:51.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the monitoring has to be out of band.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.41,0:34:56.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is because if you're if you tell an intelligent person, "Hey, listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.26,0:34:59.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm going to sit here and watch you do your work to make sure you're doing it right."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.12,0:34:59.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.76,0:35:00.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.72,0:35:06.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to sit here and watch you make sure that you're serving customers properly and that you're working hard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.71,0:35:07.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.52,0:35:12.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,That that autonomous system is going to behave differently than when you're not watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.28,0:35:14.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's like Brad's in the room with me or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.04,0:35:15.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.80,0:35:16.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.56,0:35:17.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.06,0:35:21.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so the the the monitoring has to be out of band and it has to have the
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.58,0:35:29.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,ability to observe that the autonomous system is doing something that was inconsistent with the policy or inconsistent with alignment,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.23,0:35:32.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you have the ability to either escalate or shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.92,0:35:33.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.24,0:35:34.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just turn off.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.13,0:35:37.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so those kind of capabilities have to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.74,0:35:39.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.13,0:35:40.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.37,0:35:41.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.32,0:35:43.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we we announced it recently called Open Shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.39,0:35:45.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have, you know, over 100 100 companies now joining us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.02,0:35:49.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've got lots and lots of activity around the world because everybody wants the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.40,0:35:56.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Starting at the highest level, you know, when I looked around the table at the White House, Yeah. um everybody around that table, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.04,0:35:57.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.94,0:35:58.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,They have kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.78,0:36:06.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think there's this view in the country that there are some leaders of super intelligence that are just yoloing, that don't really care.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.56,0:36:07.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're being reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.54,0:36:09.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,They just want to grab all the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.17,0:36:16.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,And yet when I looked around their table that table, there wasn't a person in there that I saw that wants to be reckless, that wants to yolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.85,0:36:22.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, everybody there wanted to find the right balance between fast and safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.04,0:36:24.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,That was the president's directive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.55,0:36:28.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I we we debated a little bit what that meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.16,0:36:28.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.61,0:36:32.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are different versions of how to implement that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.19,0:36:38.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, you know, what would you say to the American public who fears that we have a reckless president or reckless leaders?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.92,0:36:40.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did you see any evidence of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.35,0:36:41.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.19,0:36:46.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you worry about the future that you're bringing into existence with superintelligence?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.84,0:36:51.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Safety and security technology Right. are part of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.96,0:36:52.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.00,0:37:01.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's some weird formulation that AI technology and safety and security are orthogonal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.48,0:37:01.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.00,0:37:06.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's kind of like the airbags and the and the braking system Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.68,0:37:11.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the radars, the cameras, um the ABS, uh the the the lane keeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.86,0:37:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of that technology is somehow independent of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.20,0:37:16.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right. understand what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.36,0:37:16.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.60,0:37:18.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The only thing that matters to the car is the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.96,0:37:19.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.84,0:37:23.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, the whole car is part of the car's technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.74,0:37:24.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I say Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.00,0:37:30.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,to accelerate AI's technology, what I mean by that is we need to accelerate the security technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.98,0:37:33.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have to accelerate the safety technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.21,0:37:35.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,They all have to be accelerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.36,0:37:35.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.72,0:37:39.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you ask me right now, I think everybody would say, "Let's accelerate security.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.40,0:37:41.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's accelerate safety technology."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.38,0:37:43.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nobody says, "No, let's pace that."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.60,0:37:44.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.12,0:37:45.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,We should accelerate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.57,0:37:47.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's all part of the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.78,0:37:52.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't separate capability, functionality from safety and security.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.45,0:37:53.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,They go as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.24,0:37:53.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.92,0:37:58.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,And when you deliver the service, nobody's going to say, "You know, good good uh you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.51,0:38:03.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I I really like the the uh the functionality of your service, but boy, is it you know, wrecking havoc."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.00,0:38:04.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.28,0:38:06.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so I I think it's all one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.68,0:38:07.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.08,0:38:11.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we treat it as all one thing, and and the industry has to treat it as one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.41,0:38:16.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,And when we say accelerate, we have to mean accelerating the entire package.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.03,0:38:18.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,And right now Including the safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.44,0:38:20.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Including Right. especially the safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.52,0:38:21.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,You mentioned pacing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.76,0:38:22.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Especially safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.96,0:38:23.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.71,0:38:27.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Some people read Pacing the Frontier by Dario um and thought that meant slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.04,0:38:32.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I thought a funny moment in the room was when the president called on his new best friend Dario.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.70,0:38:34.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,He He referred to him in that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.56,0:38:39.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And he said, you know, explain to me, you know, the your version of fast and safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.24,0:38:45.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Dario started off by saying, "Mr. President, you said whoever wins AI wins."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.00,0:38:46.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.48,0:38:54.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And he said that we're all speeding up, that they're speeding up, that they want to go fast, that they want to, you know, win the race with China.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.95,0:38:59.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,But also acknowledge that along the way we just, to your point you just made,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.11,0:39:03.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,we have to make sure the safety systems are also speeding up and also keeping pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.20,0:39:06.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, I thought that was an important moment where you had, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.66,0:39:11.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,because I think people have positioned him as though he's in opposition, right, to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.13,0:39:14.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,But it seemed to me that you were all very much on the same page.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.97,0:39:22.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,You I You went to the cabinet room with him and and Greg and the other Frontier Labs to sign, uh you know, this agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.42,0:39:26.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Was there any chatter, you know, in that room about differences of opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.58,0:39:29.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or was everybody, uh you obviously got it signed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.42,0:39:31.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did anybody have to be put in a headlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.20,0:39:32.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or did everybody go willingly?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.92,0:39:37.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,No, everybody was very very constructive, very productive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.99,0:39:48.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And um I I I think that that without exception, everybody um is dedicated to advancing the industry safely and securely.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.32,0:39:53.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is because if it's not safe, it's not secure, the functionality will never get a chance to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.68,0:39:56.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the capability will never get a get a chance to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.74,0:40:02.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, we have to We know that the priorities are at all times safety and security.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.19,0:40:07.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course, recognizing that this industry came through a transition just recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.52,0:40:07.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.88,0:40:09.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,It wasn't but 6 months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.32,0:40:10.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.32,0:40:11.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,This technology barely worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.72,0:40:12.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.24,0:40:16.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the functionality and Without functionality capability, what's the point of making it safe and secure?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.56,0:40:18.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nobody even cares about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.20,0:40:23.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the obviously the first the first job of AI is to to demonstrate it could do something useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.31,0:40:23.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.63,0:40:26.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it really reached that point 6 months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.10,0:40:31.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so now it really wants to be deployed and and that and broadly deployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.50,0:40:38.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so there's no question that the industry the entire industry now has a has a strategic imperative,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.06,0:40:44.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,an incredible imperative, and great urgency to make sure that whatever we deploy is safe and secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.48,0:40:49.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so I think I think everybody has completely convinced capable aligned functionality,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.99,0:40:54.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,capability, safety, security, they're all at exactly the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.50,0:40:55.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Priority number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.79,0:41:00.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so um I the question is winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.92,0:41:01.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.24,0:41:10.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um I would reframe winning not of the technology industry winning, not of just the AI industry winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.06,0:41:13.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um America winning means every industry in America winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.60,0:41:14.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Healthcare.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.36,0:41:14.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.85,0:41:16.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nothing would give me more joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.11,0:41:21.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The definition of America winning is when we talk about Lilly winning, Walmart winning,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.64,0:41:26.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,FedEx winning, every single one Boeing winning, um the US military winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.84,0:41:27.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every citizen winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.72,0:41:29.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every citizen winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.61,0:41:33.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so uh uh our universities winning, our high schools winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.09,0:41:35.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um you know, that's the definition of winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.76,0:41:41.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,The winning with there is no winning if it's just the technology winning, but nobody used it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.32,0:41:41.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.94,0:41:42.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.56,0:41:49.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,What what The greatest risk is Of course we're going to you know, I I'll just take it I'll just say baseline.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.80,0:41:55.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh there will be no technology there will be no AI technology industry if we don't build it safely and securely.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.72,0:41:56.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.06,0:41:58.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,The This is an existential issue for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.80,0:41:59.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.32,0:42:02.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and it'll if we make it an existential industry for everybody else,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.72,0:42:05.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,well that's not going to happen because it'll be an existential issue for us first.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.76,0:42:06.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.12,0:42:14.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,So so having said that, the definition of winning for us and and I you know, this is the this is the part I always have to change a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.40,0:42:14.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.88,0:42:16.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want us to pivot.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.32,0:42:16.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.00,0:42:18.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want us to pivot.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.50,0:42:24.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And And when I see AI winning, America AI winning, I'm looking down from, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.61,0:42:27.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,these days we spend a lot of time in the air, and we're just looking down.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.95,0:42:31.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every state's winning, every county's winning, every community is winning, every company's winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.96,0:42:36.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everybody won because we could afford to spend more on healthcare, we could afford to spend more on education,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.76,0:42:42.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,we could afford to spend more on interstate, you know, commerce, highways, etc. All of the infrastructure of the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.54,0:42:50.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,What I hear you saying is the definition of winning is that when we look back 25, 30, 40 years from now, the economy needs to be 10 times as large.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.17,0:42:52.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everybody's lives need to be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.19,0:42:58.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And existential and primary to all of that is that it has to be done in a way that's aligned with human interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.28,0:43:03.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which This is the last question I have on on on this and I know we have a lot to get to.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.68,0:43:07.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Most people don't understand what our security framework it it is in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.89,0:43:12.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um I've said we have the most robust superintelligent framework in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.84,0:43:19.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um we're we're clearly the only country on the planet that's actually sanctioned a model and pulled it off the shelf with Mythos earlier this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.14,0:43:21.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I describe it as a three-legged stool.
