Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.24,1:37:27.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we should express our worries.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.36,1:37:29.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,We should express our concerns.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.72,1:37:32.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we shouldn't predict the end of things.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.80,1:37:33.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.19,1:37:38.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because they're underestimating the human condition, they're underestimating the human capacity,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.26,1:37:46.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,and they think for some some reason with maybe it's just hubris, maybe it's arrogance, that unless they do it, it won't get done.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.92,1:37:47.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.33,1:37:47.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.74,1:37:50.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unless they do it, it won't get done.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.04,1:37:55.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,The fact of the matter is this company is doing amazing things whether I say it or not.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.24,1:37:59.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, and I you know, I get I get all the accolades and the blame.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.50,1:38:03.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,But um in both cases in both cases I'm fair.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.72,1:38:06.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm especially the accolades.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.12,1:38:09.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and so I and the reason for that is just these you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.22,1:38:15.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,when you surround yourself with amazing people and you create the conditions by which everybody wants the same outcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.88,1:38:17.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,The good the good version of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.37,1:38:18.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I think most people do.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.54,1:38:24.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's the reason why I say we need to we need to hold ourselves accountable and responsible.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.84,1:38:27.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we should express a future that's optimistic.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.65,1:38:28.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.33,1:38:35.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I am I am 99.99% certain that surrounded by all the amazing people in the world, we're going to get there together.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.64,1:38:37.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, agreed.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.48,1:38:40.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's a I think you're a national treasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.37,1:38:43.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're lucky to have you helping to lead the charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.60,1:38:48.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,The nation's indebted to you for getting everybody together, getting us all on the same page, building the framework.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.56,1:38:51.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's going to be more work to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.40,1:38:56.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,But as a father of two and I know you you have kids, you're going to have grandkids.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.73,1:38:58.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,We don't care about anything more.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.88,1:38:59.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.52,1:39:02.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Than actually building a better world for them, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.22,1:39:03.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,We could easily stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.48,1:39:05.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if we stop today, we lose, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.89,1:39:08.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We lose the opportunity at that better world.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.20,1:39:09.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we'll wrap it there.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.78,1:39:10.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Jensen.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.88,1:39:11.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.02,1:39:15.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Brad, thank you for I've never met a greater patriot.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.02,1:39:21.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Somebody who who cares so much about the industry but even more so the
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.38,1:39:29.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,country and and your your gift your gift in your enthusiasm and just tireless energy.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.56,1:39:38.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,In in coordinating pulling together a lot of people in order to do something great like what you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.32,1:39:48.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
